A patch on upstream Mermaid at the pin, for the reference ferrigura is checked against
(docs-port/ORACLE-PLAN.md). Applied in the order of the file names by tools/reference/setup.sh.

fix(railroad): keep railroad-only options in front matter and directives

The schema defaults generator skipped the `railroad` section, so
`defaultConfig.railroad` held only the colours and typography that
`defaultConfig.ts` sets to `undefined`. Options only railroad has, such
as `arcRadius`, `compactMode`, `verticalSeparation` and
`horizontalSeparation`, were missing from `configKeys`, and
sanitizeDirective dropped them from front matter and directives.

Generate the section's defaults. Its layout defaults match the
renderer's fallbacks, and `defaultConfig.ts` keeps the theme-derived
colours and typography `undefined`, so the default rendering does not
change. A new test pins that split.

The fork's commit b14103f27, its changes to packages/ and .build/.

